Bundled third-party material
----------------------------
- YuNet face detector (yunet.onnx) - OpenCV Zoo, Apache-2.0.
- MediaPipe selfie segmentation (selfie_segmentation_landscape.onnx), ONNX conversion by onnx-community
  - Apache-2.0.
- Noto Emoji pictures (assets/emoji) - Google, Apache-2.0, pinned commit 99701e07d3d1fe1bdbcdb14964547f0fd592966f.
- sample-portrait.jpg - NASA portrait of Neil Armstrong, public domain in the United States.

Details, hashes and sources: src/anycam/assets/models/NOTICE.md and src/anycam/assets/emoji/NOTICE.md.

Not bundled
-----------
- Robust Video Matting (rvm_mobilenetv3_fp32.onnx), GPL-3.0, https://github.com/PeterL1n/RobustVideoMatting.
  Downloaded from the author's release only when you click Download in Settings -> AI effects, and verified
  against a pinned SHA-256. Its licence does not allow bundling it in this MIT package.

Runtime dependencies (installed separately, each under its own licence)
------------------------------------------------------------------------
GStreamer (LGPL; some plugins GPL/proprietary - x264enc is GPL), PySide6/Qt (LGPL), PyGObject (LGPL),
NumPy, Pillow, psutil, onnxruntime (MIT), cryptography and segno (optional).
